              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yasigama, nahanzuka nu mwoyo munene na avoora, “Mwami! Utavaliza vwoni yivu kuvo mba.” Lwa yamala kovora yaga, yakuza.",
